1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,561
Begitu juga sembahyang.

2
00:00:02,561 --> 00:00:06,000
Orang musafir ni sembahyang dua-dua

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,200
pada yang empat rakaat, sembahyang dua-dua.

4
00:00:10,933 --> 00:00:14,000
Yang tiga tak jadi dua, tak

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:14,300
jadi satu setengah.

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,765
Yang dua pun tak jadi satu,

7
00:00:16,765 --> 00:00:18,446
bukannya setengah.

8
00:00:18,446 --> 00:00:21,120
Orang musafir ni sembahyang empat

9
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:22,000
jadi dua.

10
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,200
Jadi

11
00:00:27,990 --> 00:00:31,200
jangan pula tak sempurna rasa

12
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:34,663
sembahyang dua, nak empat juga.

13
00:00:34,663 --> 00:00:37,160
Sebenarnya sembahyang dua tu lebih

14
00:00:37,160 --> 00:00:38,750
besar pahala lagi daripada

15
00:00:38,750 --> 00:00:42,000
sembahyang empat, walaupun empat tu banyak.

16
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:43,200
Dapat

17
00:00:43,990 --> 00:00:46,850
kita pahala sunnah Rasulullah, ikut

18
00:00:46,850 --> 00:00:48,000
cara Nabi.

19
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,200
Diberi

20
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:51,200
kelonggaran.

21
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Gunakanlah kelonggaran itu.

22
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,256
Jamak taqdim boleh.

23
00:00:56,256 --> 00:00:58,000
Jamak takhir boleh.

24
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,433
Nak di awal pun boleh.

25
00:01:00,433 --> 00:01:02,000
Nak di akhir pun boleh.
